abstract: >
  Unified repository containing the TQE foundational laws, cycle model,
  black-hole cleanup analysis, and multiple simulation pipelines (v1.0.0 and
  v4.2.0 Pro) that implement the energy–information coupling across cosmological
  phases. Cite this work when reusing any manuscripts, methodological notes, or
  code from the TQE_simulation project root.

